":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取本项目妊娠事件报告与随访操作规程及药物警戒计划中妊娠条款后撰写","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_88_01","missing_source_classes":["本项目妊娠事件报告与随访操作规程","本项目药物警戒计划妊娠条款"],"target":"8.8节全文"}],"heading":"妊娠事件的报告与随访","missing_source_classes":["本项目妊娠事件报告与随访操作规程（含报告表格式、报告对象与时限、随访终点、避孕要求、伴侣妊娠处理、新生儿随访）","本项目药物警戒计划中妊娠相关条款"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本项目研究事实列出'妊娠检测（育龄女性）'为安全性终点，但未提供妊娠事件的报告流程（报告表、报告对象与时限）、妊娠随访终点、避孕方法要求、伴侣妊娠处理、新生儿随访期限及终止条件。公司语料中妊娠报告条款来自其他项目，不得决定本项目的妊娠处理规则。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（妊娠事件的报告与随访）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_373934cd271ed16a","section_number":"8.8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:afa511ab9977e8b1752f03b2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012162558_4b2a4f46","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"统计分析策略：FAS主分析：缓解率比较用CMH检验/logistic回归（双侧α=0.10，探索性）；连续终点ANCOVA/MMRM；安全性SS描述汇总；SAP另行制定。","quote_sha256":"752afa90c116aedf154d688d0d29f6b01da645103d33010e450a4c859830f326","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略估计目标（treatment policy），FAS；补救治疗按治疗策略纳入；细节见SAP。","quote_sha256":"3b07921a61ffd9b704d35c3d1356c07b5c7188baecddd0956a49c721663b54cf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_05"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"样本量策略：每组40例、三组共120例（3:3:3随机）；探索性精度考量；见SAP。","quote_sha256":"e07fcb5f157690d376c8a09bc62f8c6eb9dfd60c8a07ac3efc1d3e1891360291","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_06"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_04","es_05","es_06"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"待SAP定稿后补充方案偏离分类及关键评估定义","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_9_01","missing_source_classes":["本项目统计分析计划"],"target":"9节PPS成员判定中重大方案偏离分类清单"},{"action":"待SAP定稿后明确TEAE是否涵盖安全性随访期D85至D98","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_9_02","missing_source_classes":["本项目统计分析计划"],"target":"9节SS中TEAE采集窗口定义"}],"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":["本项目统计分析计划（SAP）中PPS方案偏离分类清单及关键评估定义","本项目SAP中TEAE采集窗口及安全性分析时间窗定义"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用治疗策略估计目标，主要疗效分析基于全分析集（FAS）。FAS定义为所有经随机化分配的受试者，无论其是否实际接受研究药物或完成治疗，均按随机化时分配的组别纳入分析；接受补救治疗的受试者按治疗策略原则保留在FAS中，不因补救治疗而排除。安全性分析集（SS）定义为至少接受一次研究药物或安慰剂模拟制剂给药的受试者，按实际接受的干预分组进行安全性描述汇总，包括TEAE发生率及严重程度（按CTCAE 5.0分级）、生命体征、12导联心电图及实验室检查较基线变化。符合方案集（PPS）定义为完成全部关键疗效评估（含第12周中心读片内镜）且无重大方案偏离的受试者；存在重大方案偏离者排除于PPS之外，重大方案偏离的具体分类清单及'关键评估'的界定在统计分析计划中明确。主要疗效终点为第12周临床缓解率（改良Mayo评分较基线下降≥2分且绝对值≤2分，直肠出血子评分0至1分，内镜子评分0至1分），160mg BID组与80mg BID组分别与安慰剂组比较，采用CMH检验或logistic回归，双侧α=0.10，属探索性分析。连续型终点采用ANCOVA或MMRM模型。安全性数据在SS中以描述性统计汇总，不设正式假设检验。样本量为每组40例、三组共120例，按3:3:3随机分配，基于探索性精度考量。统计分析计划另行制定。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持：治疗策略估计目标与FAS定义、SS描述汇总框架、PPS需含方案偏离排除条款（监管通用结构）、主要终点定义与比较方式、CMH/logistic回归及α=0.10、ANCOVA/MMRM、样本量120例3:3:3、安全性随访期D85至D98。待医学经理确认：SS是否纳入仅接受安慰剂模拟制剂者、TEAE采集窗口是否延伸至D98、PPS中'重大方案偏离'分类清单及'关键评估'具体定义、SAP中是否需补充亚组分析或敏感性分析。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（统计分析）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、估计目标、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_95a63d03832626c9","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:afa511ab9977e8b1752f03b2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"c201a0910f2dba7ab14534c873e6f2b06cc15eb34c42343a8fc0f0462a068763","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_0d2c837ebee7effc:full-draft:afa511ab9977e8b1752f03b2","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:afa511ab9977e8b1752f03b2","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d8b4e74314ea8600f6e332c9315e43e742fa7765d4659f4dac067ea7f8d977b1:afa511ab9977e8b1752f03b2","text_sha256":"c201a0910f2dba7ab14534c873e6f2b06cc15eb34c42343a8fc0f0462a068763"},{"content_sha256":"b1cdf82eef4117c1236a8289de21d3f040921de464d4a165b639b13b0018592d","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","text_sha256":"b1cdf82eef4117c1236a8289de21d3f040921de464d4a165b639b13b0018592d"},{"content_sha256":"e9a73951b4b81029575c055f51e285b89ca3c683bf8d59bb10d324446e599f88","locator":"section:不良事件的随访|block:831|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"f386be5d8f9bc2","text_sha256":"e9a73951b4b81029575c055f51e285b89ca3c683bf8d59bb10d324446e599f88"},{"content_sha256":"47